    <note type="project" target="#dat1">This manuscript was likely composed sometime in late 1887 or 1888, prior to the publication of <hi rend="italic">November Boughs</hi> in late October or early November of 1888.</note>
    
    <note type="work_relations" target="xxx.00310" cert="high">A manuscript of trial titles. Whitman eventually settled on the title "Sands at Seventy," which he gave to the opening poetry section of his 1888 volume of poetry and prose entitled <hi rend="italic">November Boughs</hi>.</note>
